{
  "date": "2026-11-10",
  "capture": "Native EN/RO/RU password-only protection UI. Numbered anchors and connector lines remain entirely outside application pixels.",
  "limitations": [
    "Apple completion/library captures use presentation fixtures; they do not prove a real encryption or card operation.",
    "Android completion fixtures perform password crypto and production private-output saving. Other Android captures are presentation fixtures.",
    "Windows/Linux captures show forms before operation; native save and completion behavior is documented in text.",
    "No physical-card decryption is demonstrated or offered in native UI. CLI certificate support remains a separate compatibility capability."
